spice
* NPN Transistor Circuit
V1 4 0 DC 12       * Voltage source +12V
V2 2 0 DC -2.7     * Voltage source -2.7V
V3 6 0 DC -4       * Test Voltage V3
V4 1 0 DC -10      * Voltage source -10V

Q1 3 2 5 NPN       * NPN Transistor, C-B-E are nodes 3, 2, 5
R1 4 3 5.6k        * Resistor 5.6kΩ
R2 5 1 2.4k        * Resistor 2.4kΩ

* Node annotations based on provided red numbers:
* Node 1 = Connected to -10V source
* Node 2 = Connected to -2.7V source (Base of Transistor)
* Node 3 = Collector of Transistor, connects to resistor R1 and test voltage V3
* Node 4 = Connected to +12V source
* Node 5 = Emitter of Transistor, connects to resistor R2
* Node 6 = Test voltage node

.end